        "sha": "9ff9db2732eb7b318202aa61f5b3e31b82a3a594",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/9ff9db2732eb7b318202aa61f5b3e31b82a3a594"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 9ff9db2732eb7b318202aa61f5b3e31b82a3a594\nparent 143a13fb2bd190e50c26bb5582c6c0a2af17867a\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1785783407 -0700\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1785783407 -0700\n\nrpc: avoid descriptor range counter overflow\n\nDescriptor ranges may end at `INT32_MAX`, but the expansion loop counts with `int`.\nIncrementing after the final index overflows, terminating the node in `-ftrapv` builds and invoking undefined behavior otherwise.\n\nUse `int64_t` so the final increment stays representable.\n",
